bashy is built on github.com/qiangli/sh, a fork of mvdan.cc/sh by
Daniel Martí (https://github.com/mvdan/sh), BSD-3-Clause. The parser,
expansion and interpreter that run every script are his work, with the
Bash 5.3 conformance and Bash# dialect patches carried in the fork.
Interactive line editing uses a fork of github.com/ergochat/readline.
